&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Scaled Operations team, composed of our outsourcing, appeals, quality assurance, data analysis, and learning &amp;amp; implementation teams, to ensure their learning and growth, set a high standard of work, and ensure cross-functional alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement a durable strategy for scaling the team as it responds to a quickly-growing volume of policy violations, user appeals, quality assurance, and external events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move effortlessly from the technical details to the big picture to identify critical areas for tooling and process improvements, collaborate across functions to find solutions, and project-manage implementing these improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent your team’s efforts to leadership, internal stakeholders, regulators, civil society, and external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love managing people - be a champion and advocate for your function and team, ensuring their growth and wellness needs are met and empowering them to do their best work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience building and managing a sophisticated Trust &amp;amp; Safety function at a technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a team in a hyper-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience briefing senior decision makers and publicly representing work to civil society and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subject matter expertise in scaling operational systems across global teams, bonus points if enforcement-based&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Business Process Outsourcing, operations tooling, and machine-learning solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively collaborate with cross-functional teams including product managers, engineers, lawyers, finance, and content moderators to find solutions to challenging problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data and statistical analysis skills with the ability to translate metrics into actionable insights and drive informed decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and ability to jump into less familiar areas and learn while doing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
