&lt;li&gt;Contributing to team and org meetings and onsites by assisting and sometimes leading the planning, taking notes, and ensuring action items are completed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finding new and efficient ways to help maximize our CBO&#39;s time, particularly acting as a &quot;goalie&quot; for their calendar who ruthlessly prioritizes their meeting requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with our travel and events teams, you&#39;ll book domestic and international travel, ensuring travel policies are followed and proper documentation is acquired (visas, conference passes, etc). Occasionally, you may travel with the CBO for large conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with several internal departments to ensure cross-functional alignment on projects and internal events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Processing all expenses for the CBO and assisting with procurement requests as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a highly motivated, organized individual with strong attention to detail who is able to work effectively and prioritize with minimal supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have clear written and verbal communication skills, and the ability to communicate with all levels of leadership and external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strong multi-tasker with an appreciation for the challenges of supporting a busy team with diverse personalities in a hybrid and remote working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to prioritize and handle multiple assignments at any given time while anticipating the needs of others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong relationship management skills, the ability to build a personal network throughout the company, and the ability to work with a variety of personalities. You also know how to push back and set boundaries with kindness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience performing administrative work that requires analysis, initiative, and discretion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to adapt in response to changing priorities and needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion to learn and contribute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to manage your bandwidth and speak up if you have too much on your plate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly proficient in G-Suite, notably GCal and GMail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of work experience in an administrative support role, particularly VP+ roles within a Business or Sales org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Asana, Notion, and Discord&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working in a hyper-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working in a gaming company or startup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
