&lt;li&gt;Meet with and present to relevant regulatory authorities on Discord’s approach to regulatory compliance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product counsel on regulatory responses and to advise on regulatory compliance-related product updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor new and updated regulations and anticipate enforcement risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our public policy and communications teams in connection with Discord’s safety communications strategy and play a role in presenting our narrative&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date canonical templates for company practices and positions on topics such as privacy, security, teen safety, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depending on overall workload and interest, you may help to defend Discord by responding to consumer complaints, small claims, and other consumer-related issues; and manage defensive matters depending on size and complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
